):** Commercial revenue & cost analysis modeling $R(x)$ and $C(x)$ to find marginal revenue and profit functions (with Revenue Curve Graph).\n\n---\n\n### Section D (5 Marks × 4 Questions = 20 Marks)\n1. **Q32 (Determinants — 5 Marks):** Solving $3 \\times 3$ system of linear equations using the Matrix Method ($A^{-1} = \\frac{\\text{adj}(A)}{|A|}, X = A^{-1}B$).\n2. **Q33 (Continuity & Differentiability — 5 Marks):** Second-order derivative proofs: $(1 - x^2)y_2 - x y_1 - 2 = 0$ (Set A) / $(1 + x^2)^2 y_2 + 2x(1 + x^2)y_1 = 2$ (Set B).\n3. **Q34 (Application of Derivatives — 5 Marks):** Real-world Maxima/Minima optimization problem: open box of maximum volume from a sheet of tin.\n4. **Q35 (Integrations — 5 Marks):** Rational integrals via partial fractions: $\\int \\frac{x^2 + 1}{x^2 - 5x + 6} dx$ (Set A) / $\\int \\frac{x^2 + x + 1}{(x+1)(x+2)} dx$ (Set B).\n\n---\n\n### Access Generated Files\nDirectory: `C:\\Users\\rajan\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\math_exam_2026\\`\n\n* **Set A Question Paper:** [Set_A_Question_Paper.docx](file:///C:/Users/rajan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/math_exam_2026/Set_A_Question_Paper.docx) | [Text Source](file:///C:/Users/rajan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/math_exam_2026/Set_A_Question_Paper.txt)\n* **Set A Marking Scheme:** [Set_A_Marking_Scheme.docx](file:///C:/Users/rajan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/math_exam_2026/Set_A_Marking_Scheme.docx) | [Text Source](file:///C:/Users/rajan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/math_exam_2026/Set_A_Marking_Scheme.txt)\n* **Set B Question Paper:** [Set_B_Question_Paper.docx](file:///C:/Users/rajan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/math_exam_2026/Set_B_Question_Paper.docx) | [Text Source](file:///C:/Users/rajan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/math_exam_2026/Set_B_Question_Paper.txt)\n* **Set B Marking Scheme:** [Set_B_Marking_Scheme.docx](file:///C:/Users/rajan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/math_exam_2026/Set_B_Marking_Scheme.docx) | [Text Source](file:///C:/Users/rajan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/math_exam_2026/Se