plication of Derivatives (Commercial revenue & cost functions with curve figure).\n3. **Section D Long Answers (4 × 5m = 20m):**\n   - **Q32:** Determinants (Linear system matrix method $A^{-1} = \\frac{\\text{adj}(A)}{|A|}, X = A^{-1}B$).\n   - **Q33:** Continuity & Differentiability (Second-order derivative proofs).\n   - **Q34:** Application of Derivatives (Open-box maximum volume optimization problem).\n   - **Q35:** Integrations (Partial fractions integral $\\int \\frac{P(x)}{Q(x)} dx$).\n4. **Equation Formatting & Alignment:**\n   - All $3 \\times 3$ and $2 \\times 2$ matrices use native MS Word square brackets $\\begin{bmatrix} \\dots \\end{bmatrix}$.\n   - All determinants use native vertical bars $\\begin{vmatrix} \\dots \\end{vmatrix}$.\n   - Single line spacing applied to allow all 3 rows (all 9 numbers) to display fully without clipping.\n\n---\n\n### Access Your Files\n\nDirectory: `C:\\Users\\rajan\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\math_exam_2026\\`\n\n* **Set A Question Paper:** [Set_A_Question_Paper.docx](file:///C:/Users/rajan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/math_exam_2026/Set_A_Question_Paper.docx) | [Text File](file:///C:/Users/rajan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/math_exam_2026/Set_A_Question_Paper.txt)\n* **Set A Marking Scheme:** [Set_A_Marking_Scheme.docx](file:///C:/Users/rajan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/math_exam_2026/Set_A_Marking_Scheme.docx) | [Text File](file:///C:/Users/rajan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/math_exam_2026/Set_A_Marking_Scheme.txt)\n* **Set B Question Paper:** [Set_B_Question_Paper.docx](file:///C:/Users/rajan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/math_exam_2026/Set_B_Question_Paper.docx) | [Text File](file:///C:/Users/rajan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/math_exam_2026/Set_B_Question_Paper.txt)\n* **Set B Marking Scheme:** [Set_B_Marking_Scheme.docx](file:///C:/Users/rajan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/math_exam_2026/Set_B_Marking_Scheme.docx) | [Text File](file:///C:/Users/rajan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/math_exam_2026/Set_B_Marking_Scheme.txt